error. The babel plugin seems to handle `.js` files without error.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/comments/1108120880/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"jesstelford","id":612020,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMjAyMA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/612020?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesstelford","html_url":"https://github.com/jesstelford","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesstelford/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesstelford/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesstelford/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesstelford/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesstelford/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesstelford/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesstelford/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesstelford/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jesstelford/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/comments/1113529715","html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/35469#issuecomment-1113529715","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/35469","id":1113529715,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBC3Cis5CXx1z","user":{"login":"wonu","id":9602236,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk2MDIyMzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9602236?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wonu","html_url":"https://github.com/wonu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wonu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wonu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wonu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wonu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wonu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wonu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wonu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wonu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wonu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-04-29T17:00:02Z","updated_at":"2022-05-01T10:44:38Z","body":"Let me share my research.\r\n\r\nBefore `v12.1.6-canary.13`, js files were transformed, if using swc, in two ways (details are omitted):\r\n- through [`jest-transformer.js`](https://github.com/vercel/next.js/blob/v12.1.6-canary.12/packages/next/build/swc/jest-transformer.js)\r\n  - [`swc/index.js::transformSync()`](https://github.com/vercel/next.js/blob/v12.1.6-canary.12/packages/next/build/swc/index.js#L217)\r\n  - [`transform.rs::transform_sync()`](https://github.com/vercel/next.js/blob/v12.1.6-canary.12/packages/next-swc/crates/napi/src/transform.rs#L237)\r\n  - [`transform.rs::exec_transform()`](https://github.com/vercel/next.js/blob/v12.1.6-canary.12/packages/next-swc/crates/napi/src/transform.rs#L191)\r\n\r\n- through [`next-swc-loader.js`](https://github.com/vercel/next.js/blob/v12.1.6-canary.12/packages/next/build/webpack/loaders/next-swc-loader.js)\r\n  - [`swc/index.js::transform()`](https://github.com/vercel/next.js/blob/v12.1.6-canary.12/packages/next/build/swc/index.js#L212)\r\n  - [`transform.rs::transform()`](https://github.com/vercel/next.js/blob/v12.1.6-canary.12/packages/next-swc/crates/napi/src/transform.rs#L228)\r\n  - [`transform.rs::schedule_transform()`](https://github.com/vercel/next.js/blob/v12.1.6-canary.12/packages/next-swc/crates/napi/src/transform.rs#L159)\r\n  - [`lib.rs::custom_before_pass()`](https://github.com/vercel/next.js/blob/v12.1.6-canary.12/packages/next-swc/crates/core/src/lib.rs#L109)\r\n  - [`relay.rs`](https://github.com/vercel/next.js/blob/v12.1.6-canary.12/packages/next-swc/crates/core/src/relay.rs) (`` `graphql` `` TaggedTemplates is checked here)\r\n\r\nI can't read Rust code, so don't know what is the difference between `transform()` and `transform_sync()`.\r\nBut the problem was there: `jest-transformer.js` didn't invoke `relay.rs`.\r\n\r\nNow things have changed.\r\nSince [`v12.1.6-canary.13`](https://github.com/vercel/next.js/blob/v12.1.6-canary.13/packages/next-swc/crates/napi/src/transform.rs), the `exec_transform()` has been removed and the two transformations are both using `schedule_transform()`, which means `jest-transformer.js` may work as expected.\r\n\r\nHowever there is another problem: `relay.rs` requires `pages_dir` parameter (see #33918).\r\n\r\n`next-swc-loader.js` sets `pagesDir` using [`get-project-dir.ts`](https://github.com/vercel/next.js/blob/af1d7c94f62ea403777adc3e480cc212c5bf6290/packages/next/lib/get-project-dir.ts), so it is okay.\r\n\r\nBut `jest-transformer.js` not sets `pagesDir` and it even cannot simply use `get-project-dir.ts`:\r\n- `get-project-dir.ts` has been depending on [`next.ts`](https://github.com/vercel/next.js/blob/af1d7c94f62ea403777adc3e480cc212c5bf6290/packages/next/bin/next.ts) since #34836, so just importing `get-project-dir.ts` starts dev([default command](https://github.com/vercel/next.js/blob/af1d7c94f62ea403777adc3e480cc212c5bf6290/packages/next/bin/next.ts#L16)) server, which is an unexpected side effect.\r\n- `getProjectDir()` needs `dir` parameter passed in [`<dir>`](https://github.com/vercel/next.js/blob/af1d7c94f62ea403777adc3e480cc212c5bf6290/packages/next/cli/next-build.ts#L39) argument in cli commands. If passing in `<dir>` explicitly in cli, there's no way to tell `jest-transformer.js` what `<dir>` is.\r\n\r\nIt is not smooth, but adding `pagesDir` parameter lets `` `graphql` `` be processed correctly with Jest anyway.\r\nAnd it's just an experiment like POC, so don't try this at work :)\r\n\r\nHope this helps you understand what's going on behind the scenes.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/comments/1113529715/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"wonu","id":9602236,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk2MDIyMzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9602236?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wonu","html_url":"https://github.com/wonu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wonu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wonu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wonu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wonu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wonu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wonu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wonu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wonu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wonu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/comments/1113545242","html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/35469#issuecomment-1113545242","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/35469","id":1113545242,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBC3Cis5CX1oa","user":{"login":"damassi","id":236943,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNjk0Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/236943?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/damassi","html_url":"https://github.com/damassi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damassi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damassi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damassi/g